// AWS SSM Document Created or Updated  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1651
// Detects creation or modification of SSM documents (CreateDocument/UpdateDocument). Malicious documents can be used to run code across many…
// False positives: Infrastructure-as-code and automation teams authoring SSM documents.
// Source: rules/execution/ssm-create-document.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^CreateDocument$/i or eventName=/^UpdateDocument$/i eventSource=/^ssm\.amazonaws\.com$/i
